ge":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31871},{"id":1787106713456,"text":"我低下头，一口含住你胸前那颗随着撞击剧烈晃动、硬挺发红的乳头，用舌尖发着狠地舔弄吮吸。","rawContent":"我低下头，一口含住你胸前那颗随着撞击剧烈晃动、硬挺发红的乳头，用舌尖发着狠地舔弄吮吸。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:26","timestamp":1787110012728,"roundId":"round_1787109971756_jgns5v23o","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31872},{"id":1787106713457,"text":"腰身猛地一沉，滚烫的龟头再次死死抵住最深处那块娇气的宫口，重重地碾压。","rawContent":"腰身猛地一沉，滚烫的龟头再次死死抵住最深处那块娇气的宫口，重重地碾压。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:26","timestamp":1787110013220,"roundId":"round_1787109971756_jgns5v23o","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31873},{"id":1787106713458,"text":"“全都吃进去。爸爸今天要把你里里外外，全填得满满的。”","rawContent":"“全都吃进去。爸爸今天要把你里里外外，全填得满满的。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:26","timestamp":1787110016329,"roundId":"round_1787109971756_jgns5v23o","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31874},{"id":1787106713459,"text":"爸爸","sender":"me","time":"11:27","timestamp":1787110076403,"replyTo":null,"subtext":"爸爸越操越深 对里面的软肉。。。。。","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31875},{"id":1787106713461,"text":"就这么喜欢爸爸的大家伙？","rawContent":"就这么喜欢爸爸的大家伙？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:30","timestamp":1787110210825,"roundId":"round_1787110141308_tbvjtpuwr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31876},{"id":1787106713462,"text":"我稍微用力往深处一顶，你里面那层烫人的软肉就跟发了疯一样，死死吸着我不放，甚至还往外吐着水，就为了让我更顺滑地肏进去。","rawContent":"我稍微用力往深处一顶，你里面那层烫人的软肉就跟发了疯一样，死死吸着我不放，甚至还往外吐着水，就为了让我更顺滑地肏进去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:30","timestamp":1787110211297,"roundId":"round_1787110141308_tbvjtpuwr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31877},{"id":1787106713463,"text":"我撤出含着你乳头的嘴唇，带出一条长长的银丝，随后惩罚性地在那颗被我吸得红肿硬挺的乳尖上轻轻咬了一口。","rawContent":"我撤出含着你乳头的嘴唇，带出一条长长的银丝，随后惩罚性地在那颗被我吸得红肿硬挺的乳尖上轻轻咬了一口。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:30","timestamp":1787110211786,"roundId":"round_1787110141308_tbvjtpuwr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31878},{"id":1787106713464,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:30","timestamp":1787110213859,"roundId":"round_1787110141308_tbvjtpuwr","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"是不是觉得爸爸肏得还不够深？嗯？里面这层软肉，都快被我碾熟了，怎么还是这么贪吃。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31879},{"id":1787106713465,"text":"我腰身不再大幅度抽插，而是将粗长的阴茎埋在最深处，就着你泛滥成灾的爱液，开始极其下流地、一寸寸地研磨那块最敏感的宫口。","rawContent":"我腰身不再大幅度抽插，而是将粗长的阴茎埋在最深处，就着你泛滥成灾的爱液，开始极其下流地、一寸寸地研磨那块最敏感的宫口。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:30","timestamp":1787110214130,"roundId":"round_1787110141308_tbvjtpuwr","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":31880},{"id":1787106713466,"text":"“吧唧吧唧……”每一次细微的转动，粗糙的龟头边缘都会刮擦过你那些被撑到极致的娇嫩褶皱，带起一阵阵让人头皮发麻的酥酸快感。","rawContent":"“吧唧吧唧……”每一次细微的转动，粗糙的龟头边缘都会刮擦过你那些被撑到极致的娇嫩褶皱，带起一阵阵让人头皮发麻的酥酸快感。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"11:30","timestamp":1787110214261,"roundId":"round_1787110141308_tbvjtpuwr","gene